  "result": "Perfect! All 139 tests pass. I've successfully added comprehensive payment tracking:\n\n\u2705 **Added error codes to src/errors.js**\n- `NOT_ISSUED` - can't record payment on draft or already-paid invoices\n- `OVERPAYMENT` - payment exceeds what is owed\n\n\u2705 **Created src/payments.js** with two functions:\n\n1. **recordPayment(invoice, { amount, date })** - records a payment\n   - Validates status is 'issued' or 'partially_paid' (error: NOT_ISSUED)\n   - Validates amount is positive integer (error: AMOUNT_INVALID)\n   - Checks amount \u2264 balance due (error: OVERPAYMENT)\n   - Appends payment to invoice.payments array\n   - Updates status:\n     - `'paid'` when payments cover total\n     - `'partially_paid'` while balance remains\n   - Returns new invoice without mutating original\n\n2. **balanceDue(invoice)** - calculates amount still owed\n   - Deducts all payments from invoice total\n   - Returns remaining balance (0 if paid)\n\n\u2705 **17 comprehensive tests** covering:\n- Single and multiple payments\n- Status transitions (issued \u2192 partially_paid \u2192 paid)\n- Draft/paid invoice protection (NOT_ISSUED)\n- Invalid amounts (zero, negative, non-integer)\n- Overpayment detection\n- Multiple partial payments\n- Balance calculations with discounts & VAT\n- No mutations of original invoice\n\nPayment tracking is now complete with proper status management and balance calculation.",
